[585.620162, "o", "Godot Engine v4.3.stable.official.77dcf97d8 - https://godotengine.org\r\n\r\n=== SceneLoader Test Harness ===\r\nOK: SceneLoader REDACTEDload present\r\nOK: Autoload has script attached\r\nOK: progress_updated signal exists\r\nOK: load_completed signal exists\r\nOK: load_failed signal exists\r\nOK: start_load method exists\r\nOK: cancel method exists\r\nOK: is_loading method exists\r\nOK: start_load returned true on first call\r\nOK: start_load returned false on second call while loading\r\nOK: load_completed fired exactly once\r\nOK: progress_updated fired at least once (2 times)\r\nOK: load_completed payload is PackedScene\r\nOK: Instantiated tree has 201 Node2D descendants (>=50)\r\nOK: start_load returned true for nonexistent path\r\nOK: load_failed fired within 1 second\r\nOK: load_completed did not fire for nonexistent path\r\nOK: is_loading() returns false after failed load\r\nWARNING: A Thread object is being destroyed without its completion having been realized.\r\nPlease call wait_to_finish() on it to ensure correct cleanup.\r\n     at: ~Thread (core/os/thread.cpp:105)\r\nOK: start_load for cancel test returned true\r\nOK: is_loading() returns false after cancel\r\nOK: start_load returns true after cancel\r\nOK: HugeLevel.tscn direct instantiate has 201 Node2D descendants\r\nOK: LoadingScreen root is Control\r\nOK: LoadingScreen has ProgressBar\r\nOK: LoadingScreen has Label\r\nALL TESTS PASSED\r\n"]
